        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>China Daily - Vocabulary Study Page</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: \"Georgia\", \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: #000;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .header {\n    background: #2E6DA4;\n    padding: 12px 18px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .logo-box {\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 30px;\n    background: #C0392B;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n  }\n  .header .brand {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .header .brand .daily {\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n  .subbar {\n    background: #eef3f7;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #cdd8e0;\n    padding: 4px 18px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #555;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .content {\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n  }\n  .textbox {\n    display: flex;\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n  }\n  .col {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding: 14px 16px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n  .col-en {\n    border-right: 1px solid #333;\n  }\n  .highlight-orange {\n    color: #d2691e;\n  }\n  .vocab-list {\n    max-width: 560px;\n  }\n  .entry {\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n  .entry-num {\n    color: #2E6DA4;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .term {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .phon {\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .def-line {\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n  .example {\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #1F6391;\n    margin: 2px 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  .zh-line {\n    color: #000;\n    margin: 2px 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  .yellow-highlight {\n    background: #FCE86B;\n    display: inline;\n  }\n  .yellow-block {\n    background: #FCE86B;\n    padding: 2px 4px;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    color: #888;\n    text-align: center;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"logo-box\"></div>\n    <div class=\"brand\">CHINA<span class=\"daily\">DAILY</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"subbar\">中国日报 &nbsp;|&nbsp; www.chinadaily.com.cn</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <div class=\"textbox\">\n      <div class=\"col col-en\">\n        began to get a little less dark in 1477, when\n        Archduke Maximilian of Austria <span class=\"highlight-orange\">commissioned</span>[5]\n        an extravagant diamond ring for his new wife. The\n        <span class=\"highlight-orange\">accessory</span>[6] grew in popularity in the Victorian era,\n        and gradually the diamond ring trend <span class=\"highlight-orange\">trickled</span>\n        <span class=\"highlight-orange\">down</span>[7] from nobility to the masses.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col col-zh\">\n        米兰至公给新婚妻子定制了一\n        枚奢侈的钻石戒指，自那以后\n        订婚戒指的含义就没那么阴暗\n        了。订婚戒指在维多利亚时代\n        变得越发流行，订婚钻戒的习\n        俗也从贵族流传到了民间。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab-list\">\n\n      <div class=\"entry\">\n        <span class=\"entry-num\">[1]</span> <span class=\"term\">twisted</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;美 /ˈtwɪstɪd/\n        <div class=\"def-line\">adj. mentally or emotionally unsound or disturbed&nbsp;&nbsp;扭曲的</div>\n        <div class=\"example\">She gave a small twisted smile.&nbsp; 她不不自然地微微一笑。</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"entry\">\n        <span class=\"entry-num\">[2]</span> <span class=\"term\">gem</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;美 /dʒem/\n        <div class=\"def-line\">n. (also gemstone) a precious stone that has been cut and</div>\n        <div class=\"def-line\">polished and is used in jewellery（经切割打磨的）宝石</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"entry\">\n        <span class=\"entry-num\">[3]</span> <span class=\"term\">anthropologist</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;美 /ˌænθrəˈpɑːlədʒɪst/&nbsp; n. 人类学家\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"entry\">\n        <span class=\"entry-num\">[4]</span> <span class=\"term\">date back to... /date from...</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;追溯到；始于；自…至今\n        <div class=\"example\">The college dates back to medieval times.</div>\n        <div class=\"zh-line\" style=\"font-style: italic; color:#1F6391;\">这所学院创办于中世纪。</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"entry\">\n        <span class=\"entry-num\">[5]</span>\n        <span class=\"yellow-highlight\"><span class=\"term\">commission</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;熟词僻义</span>\n        <div class=\"yellow-block\">\n          v. to officially ask sb to write, make or create sth or to do a<br>\n          task for you 正式委托（谱写或制作、创作、完成）\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"example\">Publishers have commissioned a French translation of the book.</div>\n        <div class=\"zh-line\" style=\"font-style: italic; color:#1F6391;\">出版商已委托人把这本书译成法语。</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"entry\">\n        <span class=\"entry-num\">[6]</span> <span class=\"term\">accessory</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;美 /əkˈsesəri/\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
